Subject: [PATCH] rt(engine,tse): port the GAT_RT hooks into the TSE
 graphics/render code

Replays 7c0fcf50 onto SamTSE/Sources/Engine. The TFE-resolved hunks
(DrawPort, GfxLibrary, Gfx_wrapper, Texture, RenderModel*, Render,
ShadowMap, Particles, Benchmark, Network) apply cleanly with
git apply --3way: 14 files, 0 conflict regions, because the touched
Classic-VK files are identical between SamTFE and SamTSE.

Ported code: Serious-Engine-RT (https://github.com/sultim-t/Serious-Engine-RT,
GPL-2.0-only) by Sultim Tsyrendashiev; original copyright notices kept.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
